      "subject": "ארץ זבת חלב ודבש",
      "rationale": "Hibraithania ĩugaga 'thĩ ĩrĩa ĩreraga iria na ũki' — kiugo זבַת (gũcokerethia kũhĩtũka) kĩngĩcotokĩrwo o na mũhiananie wa ũgima wa bũrũri."
    },
    {
      "kind": "substitution",
      "subject": "זרעם",
      "rationale": "Kiugo gĩkoni 'mbĩtũ cia mbaĩ' — kiugo kĩa Hibraithania nĩ 'kũa' (zerа), kĩngĩtaũrwo ta 'kũa kwa mbaĩ'."
    },
    {
      "kind": "measurement",
      "subject": "תאריכו ימים",
      "rationale": "Kĩcunjĩ kĩa gũtheereera mĩthenya — kũgeria ngũrũ ya miario thĩ ĩrĩa andũ aekũ."
    },
    {
      "kind": "addition",
      "subject": "yanyu \/ anyu",
      "rationale": "Mĩhari ĩrĩa cia Gĩkũyũ ciongererwo kũonania mwĩhia wa 'you' wa Hibraithania iria ĩrĩ mora-inĩ ma ciugo."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Na ngeetha mĩthenya yanyu ĩgĩtheereere thĩ ĩrĩa Yahwe aarahĩire aca anyu atũhe nao na mbĩtũ cia mbaĩ yao — bũrũri ũhĩtaga iria na ũki.",
